{title: Ankhiyon Ke Jharokhon Se}
{artist: Ravindra Jain Hemlata}
{key: F#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[F#m]Ankhiyo ke jharoko se
[E]maine dekha jo sanware
[C#m]Tum dur [E]najar aaye
[F#m]badi dur najar aaye
[F#m]Band karke jharoko ko
[E]jara baithee jo sochne
[C#m]Mann me [E]tumhi muskaye
[F#m]Mann me tumhi muskaye
[F#m]Ankhiyo ke jharoko se..
[F#m]Ek mann tha mere pas,
[F#m]woh abb [E]khone laga hai
[G#m]Pakar tujhe [A]hai mujhe
[F#m]kuchh hone laga hai
[F#m]Ek tere bharose pe
[E]sab baithi hu bhul ke
[C#m]Yuhi umar [E]gujar jayey
[F#m]tere sath gujar jayey
[F#m]Ankhiyo ke jharoko se
[F#m]Jiti hu tujhe dekh ke,
[F#m]marti hu [E]tumhi pe
[G#m]Tum ho [A]jahan sajan meri
[F#m]dooniya hai wahin pe
[F#m]Din rat duwa mange
[E]mera mann tere waste
[C#m]Kabhi apni [E]ummido kaa
[F#m]kahi phul naa murjhaye
[F#m]Ankhiyo ke jharoko se
